                                "sense_id": "41d2efce-03f2-36cf-bc71-b174fe848313",
                                "text": "The northeast corner has coal mines, old railroad towns and, along the Wyoming border, the Uinta Mountains, uncrossed by road and showing hardly a sign of civilization."
